OL,3,GNEWSAHospitals' ratings downgraded by
OL,4,ACQC
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo hospitals have been told to improve
OL,7,Fafter being visited by a health
OL,8,Fwatchdog.
OL,10,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC)
OL,11,Fdowngraded Royal Derby Hospital and
OL,12,FQueen's Hospital in Burton-upon-Trent
OL,13,Ffrom rated good to "requires
OL,14,Fimprovement", after inspecting both
OL,15,Fsites in February.
OL,17,FIt comes months after it was revealed
OL,18,Fthe number of complaints about the
OL,19,Fhospitals from members of the public
OL,20,Fhad risen by 40% in a year.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
