OL,3,GNEWSAHospitals' ratings downgraded by
OL,4,ACQC
OL,5,
OL,6,FUniversity Hospitals of Derby and
OL,7,FBurton NHS Foundation Trust (UHDB),
OL,8,Fwhich runs both hospitals, said its
OL,9,Fmanagement "fully accept the concerns
OL,10,Fidentified".
